<title>UK: Little buying interest seen on UK meals market.</title>
<headline>Little buying interest seen on UK meals market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buyers were again mostly keeping to the sidelines of the UK meals and feeds market on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Buyers don't want to know at current levels,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal was unchanged to around one stg down following the lower close in Chicago on Monday.</p>
<p>The only trade reported was for A.D.M. rapemeal, which fetched 124 stg a tonne for November ex-mill Erith.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
